{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 102,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear my prayer, O Jehovah,\nAnd let my cry come unto thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hide not thy face from me in the day of my distress:\nIncline thine ear unto me;\nIn the day when I call answer me speedily.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For my days consume away like smoke,\nAnd my bones are burned as a firebrand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My heart is smitten like grass, and withered;\nFor I forget to eat my bread.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By reason of the voice of my groaning\nMy bones cleave to my flesh.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I am like a pelican of the wilderness;\nI am become as an owl of the waste places.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I watch, and am become like a sparrow\nThat is alone upon the house-top.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Mine enemies reproach me all the day;\nThey that are mad against me do curse by me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I have eaten ashes like bread,\nAnd mingled my drink with weeping,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Because of thine indignation and thy wrath:\nFor thou hast taken me up, and cast me away.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My days are like a shadow that declineth;\nAnd I am withered like grass.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But thou, O Jehovah, wilt abide for ever;\nAnd thy memorial ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "name",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " unto all generations.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou wilt arise, and have mercy upon Zion;\nFor it is time to have pity upon her,\nYea, the set time is come.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thy servants take pleasure in her stones,\nAnd have pity upon her dust.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So the nations shall fear the name of Jehovah,\nAnd all the kings of the earth thy glory.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For Jehovah hath built up Zion;\nHe hath appeared in his glory.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He hath regarded the prayer of the destitute,\nAnd hath not despised their prayer.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "This shall be written for the generation to come;\nAnd a people which shall be created shall praise Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he hath looked down from the height of his sanctuary;\nFrom heaven did Jehovah behold the earth;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To hear the sighing of the prisoner;\nTo loose those that are appointed to death;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That men may declare the name of Jehovah in Zion,\nAnd his praise in Jerusalem;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When the peoples are gathered together,\nAnd the kingdoms, to serve Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He weakened my strength in the way;\nHe shortened my days.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I said, O my God, take me not away in the midst of my days:\nThy years are throughout all generations.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Of old didst thou lay the foundation of the earth;\nAnd the heavens are the work of thy hands.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They shall perish, but thou shalt endure;\nYea, all of them shall wax old like a garment;\nAs a vesture shalt thou change them, and they shall be changed:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But thou art the same,\nAnd thy years shall have no end.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.102.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.102.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The children of thy servants shall continue,\nAnd their seed shall be established before thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Prayer of an afflicted one for mercy on himself and on Zion.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "A Prayer of the afflicted, when he Or, faintethis overwhelmed, and poureth out his complaint before Jehovah.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
